{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/03/09/1272441/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台「じょしらく」について\n発表されましたね(๑•̀‧̫•́๑)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台の詳細はまだ分からないのですが、\nとりあえず！！\n内容を知らないことには始まらない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なので\nTSUTAYAで漫画6巻借りました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"蕪羅亭 魔梨威ちゃんが\n一番好みかなあ～♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アルバム京都個握"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/03/09/1272441/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなり前になってしまいましたが\nありがとうございましたっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/03/09/1272441/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"春メロ衣装と♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/03/09/1272441/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"君の名衣装♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アルバム個握は残すところ\n名古屋のみ☆\nどの衣装着ようかな～♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてこの日は握手会の合間に\nのぎ天生放送していましたっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"能條さんMCで\n私はアシスタントさせていただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/03/09/1272441/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"琴子とお揃いしたよ～～(｡･ω･｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その時の生放送の様子が\nダイジェストではありますが\n配信されています！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"映像を見ながら新たにトークも\n収録したので\n観て下さい～(๑•̀‧̫•́๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして昨日は大撮影会でした！\nありがとうございました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影がメインなので\n会話はそこまで出来なかったけど、\nみんなの真剣な表情が\n普段と違くて新鮮でした♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/03/09/1272441/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クレープ屋さんが来てたの♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クレープはもちろん美味しいけど、\nクレープ屋さんの車が\nすごいすごい可愛くて大興奮。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このクレープの紙？も可愛いし、\n置いてあったミニカーが最高に可愛くて\n興奮してたら店員さんがくれたの！♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/03/09/1272441/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミニカーも集め出したら、キリないから\n手を出していなかったけど、\nこの子はもうレトロな感じと色と、\n丸みを帯びたフォルムが可愛い♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「命は美しい」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一足お先にCDいただいたんだけど、\nひなことまあやのPVが\n可愛すぎる！好きすぎる！(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/